D199|no-type-scan-on-hot-paths|decided|memory_type column is metadata, not a traversal key. All hot-path navigation goes by ID. get_by_type() is admin/diagnostic only. Candidate pools must use indexed columns (activation_count) or ID-based traversal from known roots. Full type scans are the wrong abstraction — trees are navigated, not searched.
