D216|basket-schema|decided|Basket = traversal context (traversal_contexts table). Reserved keys: __status__ (running/halted/complete/error/branched/timeout), __error__ (last exception), __init__ (presence flag). Standard input keys: input (trigger text), user_input (alias), node_id (habit.id), trigger_type. Declared defaults via basket_schema in metadata (merged before step 1, priority: basket_schema < ctx_init < standard inputs < ctx_override). Write-back contract: ephemeral only — persistence via prim_emit return or code_ref tool DB writes, no auto-persist. __status__ written by runtime at start (running) and end (complete/error/timeout). schema_runner.py updated.
D217|temporal-pipeline-model|decided|Tier ladder is a continuous temporal pipe with checkpoint positions (~0ms tier.0 → ~100ms tier.1 → ~500ms tier.3.5 → ~2s tier.4), not a waterfall fallback chain. Weaning = installing plugs at earlier positions. Affective pipeline is a parallel stream. Training = watch cloud escapes, build plugs.
