D256|timestamp-node-id|decided|Node ID = YYYYMMDDHHMMSSuuuuuu (microseconds); node_registry(node_id, table_name, row_id) in Postgres; Redis cache for O(1) lookup; serial calving protocol
D257|tree-as-traversal-index|decided|A tree is a named traversal pattern over a shared node pool; same node can be facia of one tree and interior of another; trees do not own nodes
D256|timestamp-node-id|decided|Node ID = YYYYMMDDHHMMSSuuuuuu.swarm_name[.instance_name][.coe_name] — suffixes appended only when >1 exists at write time; ALL existing nodes migrate to new IDs (best-guess dates from created_at/git, undateable nodes anchor to earliest memory + 1us offsets); node_registry(node_id, table_name, row_id, machine_id, created_at) in Postgres; Redis cache for O(1) lookup; serial calving threshold ~500 nodes, attractor detection via embeddings + TWM heat (separate sub-problem)
D258|coa-isolation-deferred|decided|COA (Center of Attention) isolation requires twm_observations + ring_memory to gain coa_id column; global memories + interpretive_edges pool stays shared; deferred to post-node-registry ticket; node_registry machine_id field is the prerequisite
D258|coa-isolation|deferred|COA (Center of Attention) isolation — each COA gets own TWM + ring_memory + narrative; coa_id FK on twm_observations + ring_memory; deferred post D257
D259|author-aware-cloud-routing|decided|author=claude-code or human → cloud_ok_override=True + is_user_turn=True for all downstream inference including background job synthesis
D260|channel-emit-execution-model|decided|EMIT emits a value (constant|basket|payload) to a named channel; basket is a valid channel; each trigger cell is independent; payload carries program cells + data fields; conditions evaluate against basket/payload; key names by receiver
D261|engram-instruction-set|decided|EMITIF/BRANCHIF/FORKIF/ENDIF instruction set: BRANCHIF stops cell+jumps, FORKIF spawns new cursor+continues, ENDIF explicit or implicit; data guard: executor only runs payload fields named in triggers.values()
D260|channel-emit-model|live|EMIT emits values (not nodes) to named channels (basket/emotional_milieu/cognitive_milieu/console/web/discord); emit_channels.py singleton registry
D261|engram-instruction-set|live|EMITIF/BRANCHIF/FORKIF/ENDIF instruction set; BRANCHIF stops cell, FORKIF spawns cursor sharing basket; node_executor.py
D262|proprioception-body-sense|live|ProprioceptionSource: tools are motor body sense (parallel to InteroceptionSource visceral) — INTERP_FACIA_* nodes always warm in TWM on 60s heartbeat
