D272|boredom-idle-loop|decided|Boredom = milieu too-settled threshold → idle traversal: threads → long-term projects (new) → EF questions tree (9 Qs) → topics tree (9 areas); COA-per-task is future direction
D273|self-healing-startup-loop|decided|Igor startup scripts (igor.sh/ps1/bat) catch unexpected exits: exit 42=restart, exit 0=stop, else capture traceback + launch claude --dangerously-skip-permissions to fix+commit+exit; debug_session.flag suppresses auto-fixer when Claude Code session active
D272|boredom-idle-loop|decided|Boredom = milieu too-settled threshold → idle traversal: threads → long-term projects (new) → EF questions tree (9 Qs) → topics tree (9 areas); COA-per-task is future direction
