D274|action-node-dispatch-gap|open|Cognitive habits (PROC_CODE_A_TICKET) load as context but action nodes (queue_task, disk_check) win dispatch — multi-step ticket workflows need thread continuity mechanism
D275|goal-as-thread|open|Goals are first-class TWM nodes: GOAL_TACTICAL (completable, success_condition, BRANCHIF on failure) vs GOAL_STRATEGIC (orientation, never completes, tilts BG scoring field)
D275|goal-as-thread|implemented|GOAL_TACTICAL memory type: success_condition, current_strategy, failure_count, TTL. Stored in cortex instance-scoped + TWM at salience 0.85 for cross-turn persistence.
D276|executive-function-persistence-hunting|implemented|goal_fail_active: failure increments count, searches cortex for alternatives, escalates to channel at 3+ failures. PROC_GOAL_STUCK fires on stuck/error signals.
D277|biological-patterns-gap-inventory|defined|6 missing biological patterns: predictive coding, lateral inhibition (BG), dopamine→weight update, chunking, refractory/habituation, homeostatic setpoints, consolidation.
D272|boredom-idle-loop|implemented|PROC_BOREDOM_TRIGGER (10min): milieu arousal<0.08 + |valence|<0.15 → EF/topic traversal → [Igor wonders] channel post. EF_FACIA + TOPICS_FACIA seeded.
D274|goal-continuation-scheduler|implemented|PROC_GOAL_CONTINUATION (2min): reads active GOAL, step 0=claim ticket, step 1=show ticket, step 2=ready signal. Closes silence gap after goal adoption.
D274|goal-continuation-scheduler|implemented|PROC_GOAL_CONTINUATION (2min): step 0=claim, step 1=show+parse grep_for via _load_ticket, step 2=grep codebase (if grep_for), step 3=ready signal. Phase D ex4 verified 2026-04-01c.
D278|goal-queue-consumer-autonomous-drain|implemented|PROC_QUEUE_DRAIN (30min): adopt_top_queue_ticket() checks for active GOAL, reads queue.json top pending ticket (priority ASC), fires goal_adopt if none active. Closes autonomy loop — Igor drains backlog unattended.
D279|predictive-coding-gap-deposit|active|Cloud escalation (non-human-author paths) deposits real-time NARRATIVE_GAP (query+reply). Refractory inhibition per topic. Paired with escalation_stats monitoring tool. Ticket to revisit trend data in ~2 weeks.
D280|engram-compare-value-sources|defined|Compare values in engram nodes: literal true, from basket, or from memory payload. Basket emit allowed. Payload write NOT allowed — payload is read-only within engram execution. Compare types TBD.
D281|"engram-branch-targets"|"defined"|"Branch
D282|"engram-compare-types"|"defined"|"Compare
D283|"engram-basket-semantics"|"defined"|"Basket
D284|"engram-null-handling"|"defined"|"Missing
D285|"engram-payload-write"|"defined"|"Payload
